{"overview":"زینب دختر باهوش، خوش رفتار و نمونه ثروتمندترین خانواده شهری است که در آن زندگی می کند، در حالی که هلیل مرد جوانی است که در سنین پایین مادر و پدرش را از دست داده و با کینه برای انتقام از خانواده اش با عمه اش زندگی می کند. این دو جوان که با وجود خانواده زندگی می کنند، خود را در یک گره کور غیرقابل تصور خواهند دید.","tagline":"","overview_en":"The daughter of the richest family in town, admired for intelligence and proper manners, finds love with Halil, who seeks to avenge his lost kin. Their unlikely bond faces obstacles from both families.","tagline_en":"","runtime":120,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":130,"y":2024,"poster":"/vGrrdx21rS69tl55mxpl9pn9ebx.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":87,"y":2024,"poster":"/rdXHWmPdd55hLY9w8roDC8kATrR.jpg"}],"episodes":217,"crew":["Ömer Baykul","Bülent Doğan"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["TR"],"cast":[{"name":"Gökberk Yıldırım","role":"Halil","photo":"/3khzEdlvPKwGElL6C19w0Ysjlll.jpg"},{"name":"Cemre Arda","role":"Zeynep","photo":"/8p8FS9Vlk7fAyX6La3RpKBdrZfG.jpg"},{"name":"Selma Kutluğ","role":"Zümrüt","photo":"/lUrk6IwZxaDMXXEHm7I1jHUkpW9.jpg"},{"name":"Zeynep Serpil Bozkurt","role":"Tülay","photo":"/DBBBvXJ645TdjQub6lL7lcXTeH.jpg"},{"name":"Sude Oduncu","role":"Gülhan","photo":"/mU3A5xaUKHTCgBtHKp5LOMdf3yY.jpg"},{"name":"Serdar Yusuf","role":"Eren","photo":"/7Vl11Vi9OALFFk64I6VpLZsuUrH.jpg"},{"name":"Dilek Aba","role":"Songül","photo":"/bPck526hlT92JkG0oxxhG9ebbo9.jpg"},{"name":"Adem Bal","role":"Cemil","photo":"/dv3tjDqIfvb3eEg1sX5wEsMG6sz.jpg"},{"name":"Ilayda Sumak","role":"Merve Alsanli","photo":"/kY86afmnqOqMiibjvmBsunv07E4.jpg"},{"name":"Furkan Bozkurt","role":"Tekin","photo":"/1VWl3PZtKQRLB9Wgc3k55ve65Y9.jpg"},{"name":"Bülent Doğan","role":"","photo":"/4CONvm0cC6yqdYrRUJPOAFju3R0.jpg"}],"trailer":"","watch":{},"recs":["s231100","s219290","s231503","s306118","s283123","s110562","s65555"],"tmdb":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/242551"}